{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress","id":1213530,"title":"Statting up the Scarlet Empress","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-04-30T14:33:59-07:00","id":1213530,"title":"Statting up the Scarlet Empress","content":"I'm working on this at the moment, and I'll share my finished results. I'm a bit hung up on her Control Spells.<br /> <br /> Terrestrial: Silent Words of Dream and Nightmares would seem quite useful for her with its control advancement; the alternate choice would be Virtuous Guardian of Flame, making that her default melee weapon, and letting her wield Evocations from it.<br /> <br /> Celestial: I'm leaning toward Travel Without Distance<br /> <br /> Thoughts?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-30T14:36:02-07:00","id":1213532,"title":"","content":"Did the Empress learn sorcerery before or after becoming Empress? IF she was still a low ranking officer who took the Realm Defense Grid, I feel like a combat spell might make sense for a control spell.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-3?affiliate_id=389642\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> My folklore and horror blog, here:<a href=\"http://undeadauthorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-30T14:43:55-07:00","id":1213534,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epee102</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1213532#post1213532\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Did the Empress learn sorcerery before or after becoming Empress? IF she was still a low ranking officer who took the Realm Defense Grid, I feel like a combat spell might make sense for a control spell.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> My thinking is no she didn't. I was going to give her an initiation via the Mantle of Brighid.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-30T15:18:10-07:00","id":1213542,"title":"","content":"Figuring out which Signature Charms she should have, I definitely agree she's Fire Aspect. Her second most favored element is Air. I'm now picturing her as an older (more emotionally stable) Azula crackling with flame and lightning.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-30T15:55:53-07:00","id":1213554,"title":"","content":"Should she have Craft? Unfortunately I feel like she needs enough expertise in First Age Artifacts to experiment with her personal arsenal and the Imperial Manse, but there's no way mechanically I'm aware of to give her that without also making her a master Artifact crafter.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 04-30-2018, 07:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-30T16:05:31-07:00","id":1213558,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1213554#post1213554\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Should she have Craft? Unfortunately I feel like she needs enough expertise in First Age Artifacts to experiment with the her personal arsenal and the Imperial Manse, but there's no way mechanically I'm aware of to give her that without also making her a master Artifact crafter.</div> </div> </div> </div>She does seem to be implied to have personally forged Imprimatur.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-30T16:07:20-07:00","id":1213561,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1213558#post1213558\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> She does seem to be implied to have personally forged Imprimatur.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ok, I'm giving her Craft Artifact 5, and Craft First Age Artifact 3, with the latter having a specialty in Repair.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-30T16:19:42-07:00","id":1213568,"title":"","content":"Ok, her Signature Charms<br /> <br /> Aspect Abilities at 5...<br /> <br /> Dodge: Unassailable Body of Fire, Safety Among Enemies<br /> Presence: Terrifying Fire-Dragon Roar, Spirit-Cultivating Leadership<br /> Socialize: Wild Fire Scandal Revelation, Clear Eyed Courtier's Scrutiny<br /> <br /> Favored Abilities...<br /> <br /> Awareness: Eyes of Blazing Truth, Dragon's Flaring Nostrils<br /> Bureaucracy: Seething Firebreak Technique, One Forest Many Trees<br /> Integrity: Flawless Diamond Heart<br /> Investigation: Shadow Immolation Talon, Warrant of Divine Safety<br /> Lore: Ten Thousand Minds Ablaze, Fulminating Thunderhead Brilliance<br /> <br /> Other Abilities at 5 (largely ones that weren't part of her expertise as a late Shogunate intelligence officer, and she built up later)<br /> <br /> Craft: Blazing Dragon Smite Arete, Ephemeral Form Composition<br /> Linguistics: Wildfire Words Technique, Rewriting the Truth Technique<br /> Occult: Smoke Ascends to Heaven, Hundred Devils Whirlwind<br /> Performance: Immolating Passion Alleluia, Thundering Dragon Proclamation","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-30T17:44:02-07:00","id":1213611,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1213542#post1213542\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Figuring out which Signature Charms she should have, I definitely agree she's Fire Aspect.</div> </div> </div> </div>She can go heavy on Fire Signatures if you like, but she's canonically an Earth Aspect. The &quot;Scarlet&quot; bit is from her having red hair and a bigass ruby in her iconic anima display, but she's not Fire.<br /> <br /> As soon as I saw the Balanced Keyword, I thought of giving the Scarlet Empress the unique ability to treat all Charms as Balanced, both as a personal power bump and as a sort of metaphysical recognition of her as the singular fount of the many-Aspected Scarlet Dynasty, but I can see arguments against establishing the precedent that awesome individuals are awesome because of system-breaking special rules.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/21733-ascension","name":"Ascension","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar21733_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"105"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-30T17:47:13-07:00","id":1213612,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ascension</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1213611#post1213611\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">but she's canonically an Earth Aspect.</div> </div> </div> </div>Only in late Second Edition, and earlier writers preportedly intended her to be Fire.<br /> <br /> The fact that her only two canonically Earth Aspected known children have the same father makes me lean against her being Earth Aspected (and toward Rawar being Earth Aspected). Meanwhile her only known Fire Aspected child (Sesus) was fathered by a mortal (Nellens), which strengthens the odds of her passing on her own Aspect.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 04-30-2018, 08:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-30T17:49:34-07:00","id":1213613,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ascension</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1213611#post1213611\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> As soon as I saw the Balanced Keyword, I thought of giving the Scarlet Empress the unique ability to treat all Charms as Balanced,</div> </div> </div> </div>That to me is really boring. Anything that strips her of a distinct feel and tactics in order to make her an uber-Dragon-Blooded I definitely want to avoid.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-30T18:25:57-07:00","id":1213621,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1213612#post1213612\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Only in late Second Edition, and earlier writers preportedly intended her to be Fire.</div> </div> </div> </div>I've not heard this before, but I came in during Second Edition, so I've only picked up 1E lore piecemeal.<br /> <br /> I feel like Earth fits her thematically as a sort of human Omphalos for the Realm, moreso than the passionate, impulsive Fire, but, eh. I know some like to play up the erotic side of the Empress, which would fit with Fire, and the &quot;let your enemies destroy themselves&quot; elements in Fire social do work with her manipulation of the Dynasty.<br /> <br /> *shrugs*<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/21733-ascension","name":"Ascension","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar21733_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"105"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-30T18:45:10-07:00","id":1213628,"title":"","content":"Keep in mind that Realm culture teaches Fire Aspects to constantly control their passions and impulses. That's why their Immaculate Dragon is a stoic.<br /> <br /> What I'd be inclined to play up is how unlike Mnemon, the Empress was forging new system whole cloth, not defending treasured institutions because she ideologically believed them. In fact she often designed aspects of the Thousand Scales and Great Houses to be constantly at each others throats on purpose in order to serve as a check on them.<br /> <br /> As a true believer in the Immaculate Philosophy, Mnemon is a structural functionalist. The Empress in contrast promotes a structural functionalist illusion while in her heart being a conflict theorist.<br /> <br /> I think that plays well with the differing Aspects in question. The Realm is like the heart of a Fire Aspect adhering to the teachings of Hesiesh - a boiling pot of emotions that must be kept in check and controlled at all times in order to harness it's incredible power.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 04-30-2018, 09:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-30T21:24:12-07:00","id":1213668,"title":"","content":"Just a thought on her learning Sorcery....could the RDG be the source of her Sorcerous Initiation? Just a thought. <br /> <br /> And I do think she'd be better as Fire. Earth didnt fit for me","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-01T07:52:36-07:00","id":1213791,"title":"","content":"At a minimum, I would imagine the RDG has some sorcery enhancing evocations.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Exalted is an aesthetic.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5526-steamfunk","name":"Steamfunk","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5526_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"222"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-01T09:35:58-07:00","id":1213818,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Steamfunk</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1213791#post1213791\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">At a minimum, I would imagine the RDG has some sorcery enhancing evocations.</div> </div> </div> </div>And might be a phylactery.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-01T10:00:53-07:00","id":1213823,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Steamfunk</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1213791#post1213791\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">At a minimum, I would imagine the RDG has some sorcery enhancing evocations.</div> </div> </div> </div>A manse with evocations...?<br /> <br /> ...Eh, stranger things are already possible.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-01T22:20:44-07:00","id":1214041,"title":"","content":"So her World of Darkness inspiration (that is in no way canonically connected, but was still the inspiration) was the Scarlet Queen, as the embodiment of Yang opposite the Ebon Dragon's embodiment of Yin. The Scarlet Queen is also often the Scarlet Phoenix.<br /> <br /> That being the case, I'm inclined to make Flight of the Brilliant Raptor her Terrestrial Control Spell. Then with Travel WIthout Distance as her Celestial Control Spell, she can have special-effects of her flame bird emerging and her grabbing its tail as they and any companions vanish in a flash of light and flame like Dumbledore and Fawkes.<br /> <br /> <br /> Sidenote: I decided Chumyo Maheka Dazan is Wood Aspect, though he heavily favors Earth as well, as is appropriate to his Gen.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-02T00:06:07-07:00","id":1214063,"title":"","content":"Just wondering, have you considered giving her a real name at all?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-02T00:24:18-07:00","id":1214066,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1214063#post1214063\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just wondering, have you considered giving her a real name at all?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yes! The name used by those who know her personally (which is not a secret, but rarely used otherwise) is &quot;Rasha&quot;. She had a different given name before the Balorian Crusade, but she left that past completely behind her, and no living Dragon-Blooded knows that name anymore.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-02T03:33:29-07:00","id":1214092,"title":"","content":"ok, I was trying to think of one when I was going to stat her as a ghost, but I'm not coining up with anything","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-02T04:07:57-07:00","id":1214097,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1213612#post1213612\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Only in late Second Edition, and earlier writers preportedly intended her to be Fire.<br /> <br /> The fact that her only two canonically Earth Aspected known children have the same father makes me lean against her being Earth Aspected (and toward Rawar being Earth Aspected). Meanwhile her only known Fire Aspected child (Sesus) was fathered by a mortal (Nellens), which strengthens the odds of her passing on her own Aspect.</div> </div> </div> </div>That said her other child with Nellens - Ledaal - was Air Aspect, make of that what you will.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 05-02-2018, 10:05 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-02T04:43:05-07:00","id":1214108,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baaldam</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1214097#post1214097\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That said her other child with Nellens - Ledaal - was Air Aspect, what of that what you will.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not in 3E, IIRC. Ledaal was an elevated Dynast of a different House who chose loyalty to the Empress over their traitor Matriarch, so the Empress bumped them up when she dissolved the preceeding House.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-02T06:22:41-07:00","id":1214129,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1214108#post1214108\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Not in 3E, IIRC. Ledaal was an elevated Dynast of a different House who chose loyalty to the Empress over their traitor Matriarch, so the Empress bumped them up when she dissolved the preceeding House.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hmm, I just remembered something... {checks back on book}<br /> <br /> \u200bAha! Ledaal is no longer Nellens' daughter, but now his <i>grand</i>daughter; the write-up for Imprimatur says that Nellens is the father of Jurul, who is the mother of Ledaal.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-02T07:42:50-07:00","id":1214154,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1213613#post1213613\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That to me is really boring. Anything that strips her of a distinct feel and tactics in order to make her an uber-Dragon-Blooded I definitely want to avoid.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I would say that giving her that acheives a very distinct feel as she would behave like no other dragonblood. Making her a fire aspect with some other signatures makes her feel like any other dragonblood, but just older with more charms.<br /> <br /> Not that there is anything wrong with that, because in a very real sense she just is an older and more powerful.<br /> <br /> If you want to make her distinct in terms of charms though I would give her some customs of some description.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2325-builder","name":"Builder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2325_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-02T07:54:10-07:00","id":1214158,"title":"","content":"Changing how Charms behave for the Empress would be bad. Changing her is a better idea.<br /> <br /> Don\u2019t give her any more favored Abilities, but it wouldn\u2019t be broken to let her have all five Aspect anima powers and let her retain any Aura when her anima achieves bonfire level. At most, let her use bonfire to change her Aura to any element she wants... but a step down from that is that she can only change her Aura to her native Fire Aspect it she doesn\u2019t choose to keep the Aura she has before bonfire.<br /> <br /> She also would still be totally a Fire Aspect in regards to Signature Charms. She can only choose two, and one has to be Fire.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":636,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","user":"Sunder the Gold","date":". 05-02-2018, 11:00 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-02T08:04:15-07:00","id":1214162,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Builder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1214154#post1214154\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> I would say that giving her that acheives a very distinct feel as she would behave like no other dragonblood. Making her a fire aspect with some other signatures makes her feel like any other dragonblood, but just older with more charms.<br /> <br /> Not that there is anything wrong with that, because in a very real sense she just is an older and more powerful.<br /> <br /> If you want to make her distinct in terms of charms though I would give her some customs of some description.</div> </div> </div> </div>By this logic, no player character is distinct because they use their splats\u2019 normal mechanics.<br /> <br /> Stripping down the barriers of theme to make her power more all encompassing, doesn\u2019t give her a distinct feel to me. It doesn\u2019t reflect her personality, her character, etc. it just makes her feel more powerful for the sake of being more powerful.<br /> <br /> I will give her some unique powers as a High Essence character, but they\u2019ll be based on who she is an individual, not just stripping away the balancing factors of the Dragon-Blooded charmset.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 05-02-2018, 11:18 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-02T19:03:52-07:00","id":1214392,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1214129#post1214129\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Hmm, I just remembered something... {checks back on book}<br /> <br /> \u200bAha! Ledaal is no longer Nellens' daughter, but now his <i>grand</i>daughter; the write-up for Imprimatur says that Nellens is the father of Jurul, who is the mother of Ledaal.</div> </div> </div> </div>Good to know, looks like i need to get myself an update on the dynastic houses' history indeed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-02T21:14:15-07:00","id":1214414,"title":"","content":"I'd be fascinated to learn what sort of Solar Circle workings you imagine she completed to attain her apparent immortality.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2223-ketrus","name":"Ketrus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"398"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-02T22:01:41-07:00","id":1214421,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1214162#post1214162\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I will give her some unique powers as a High Essence character, but they\u2019ll be based on who she is an individual, not just stripping away the balancing factors of the Dragon-Blooded charmset.</div> </div> </div> </div>This. Essence 6+ Charms are (now) specifically supposed to be unique, character-defining abilities. Having a few is more than enough to make the Empress seem like the biggest baddest dragon on the block.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-03T00:00:19-07:00","id":1214446,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ketrus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1214414#post1214414\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd be fascinated to learn what sort of Solar Circle workings you imagine she completed to attain her apparent immortality.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> sinc when is she immortal?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-03T01:15:43-07:00","id":1214470,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1214446#post1214446\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">sinc when is she immortal?</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;<i>Apparently</i> immortal,&quot; and personally I'd guess since somewhere along the way to becoming at least ~790 years old with an Exaltation that typically gives you ~300 years tops.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-03T09:34:26-07:00","id":1214645,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sith_Happens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1214421#post1214421\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> This. Essence 6+ Charms are (now) specifically supposed to be unique, character-defining abilities. Having a few is more than enough to make the Empress seem like the biggest baddest dragon on the block.</div> </div> </div> </div>Especially as she is probably the only Essence 6 Dragonblood around. (For her age, she actually could be Essence 5, or even 4, but I think it's reasonable for her to be Essence 6).<br /> <br /> As to her immortality*, if it's got serious conditions attached, I'd suggest that actually Celestial 3 is fine, it doesn't need to be Solar. &quot;Restoring someone to the prime of youth&quot; is an example Solar 1 working though.<br /> <br /> *It may not actually be immortality. It might be she just slowed down her aging substantially. It's quite possible that she's 100 years from dying of old age, but as DBs stay in their prime until a few decades before death, it hasn't shown up yet.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-03T09:37:43-07:00","id":1214647,"title":"","content":"I think the Scarlet Empress can be described as functionally immortal, for the sake of brevity, if she's still portrayed as somebody that acted as though she didn't expect to die any time soon. First Edition has a reference to her declaring that she would name an heir when she reached the 1,000th year of her reign, and everybody treating such a number seriously because she had already outlived many of her own children.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-03T10:45:34-07:00","id":1214675,"title":"","content":"In 3E, what she\u2019s doing with Anathema in the Imperial Manse might play into her preserved life. I was thinking Anathema blood was part of her second Shaping ritual.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-03T23:53:50-07:00","id":1214943,"title":"","content":"So one idea I have for a high essence personal effect for her is a warped version of Immolating Phoenix-Soul Fury that turns the flames inwards instead of outwards.<br /> <br /> Effectively in the event of a Psyche effect actually overcoming her other mental defenses, her essence becomes enflamed and deals her bashing damage instead of taking mental hold.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-03T23:56:56-07:00","id":1214945,"title":"","content":"ok, bad idea time again<br /> <br /> What if her real name is Joha Ansen?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-04T06:41:25-07:00","id":1215020,"title":"","content":"Considering those two upgrades I suggested for the empress, I can break the second one down into three levels of possible power. In order from weakest to strongest:<br /> <br /> 1) When she achieves bonfire, she can prevent her Aura from conforming to her primary Aspect.<br /> <br /> 2) When she achieves bonfire with an Aura of an element that isn\u2019t her primary Aspect, she may change that Aura to any element.<br /> <br /> 3) When she achieves bonfire, her Aura becomes whatever element she wants.<br /> <br /> <br /> I think the third possibility is the least interesting.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":636,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","user":"Sunder the Gold","date":". 05-04-2018, 09:45 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-04T09:34:06-07:00","id":1215108,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1214945#post1214945\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">ok, bad idea time again<br /> <br /> What if her real name is Joha Ansen?</div> </div> </div> </div>Better/worse idea: what if it's Erza?<br /> <br /> EDIT: On the subject of her Essence 6-7 Charms, one of them should definitely be something in Bureaucracy or Socialize designed to cement her abilities as a ridiculous political mastermind.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":13313,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","user":"Sith_Happens","date":". 05-04-2018, 12:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-04T20:38:49-07:00","id":1215334,"title":"","content":"* actually the main idea here is covered by an existing Charm, never mind *","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 05-05-2018, 12:51 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-04T20:49:06-07:00","id":1215335,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sith_Happens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1215108#post1215108\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> EDIT: On the subject of her Essence 6-7 Charms, one of them should definitely be something in Bureaucracy or Socialize designed to cement her abilities as a ridiculous political mastermind.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm open to suggestions","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-04T22:42:39-07:00","id":1215372,"title":"","content":"Ooh, I know, something like Master Plan Meditation but for projects and political maneuvering. You think that after years of scheming, favor-hoarding, and string-pulling you've finally pulled one over on her, but then she dumps a dozen contingency points and explains exactly how <i>she</i>'s been playing <i>you</i> the whole time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-05T11:57:49-07:00","id":1215566,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sith_Happens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1215372#post1215372\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ooh, I know, something like Master Plan Meditation but for projects and political maneuvering. You think that after years of scheming, favor-hoarding, and string-pulling you've finally pulled one over on her, but then she dumps a dozen contingency points and explains exactly how <i>she</i>'s been playing <i>you</i> the whole time.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> That's a really interesting idea for a Charm, but I'm not sure how necessary it is for an NPC. Maser Plan Meditation basically exists for players to get to handwave stuff that their genius character has accomplished without needing to roleplay it in advance. With NPCs, the Storyteller can do that already without a Charm.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-05T18:29:11-07:00","id":1215641,"title":"","content":"I think it'd make sense for Her Redness to have 2, maybe 3 e6 charms? certainly no more than 3. If I was statting her up I'd give her a power that might, for example, let her tap into her lingering control over the Sword of Creation and go all Avatar State on some chumps. There are a couple writeups for gods on this forum (Omicron's and Crumplepunch's come to mind) where they can access a sort of boss-fight super form.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11619-kymmetheseventh","name":"KymmetheSeventh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11619_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"151"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-05T18:42:36-07:00","id":1215644,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KymmetheSeventh</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1215641#post1215641\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think it'd make sense for Her Redness to have 2, maybe 3 e6 charms? certainly no more than 3. If I was statting her up I'd give her a power that might, for example, let her tap into her lingering control over the Sword of Creation and go all Avatar State on some chumps. There are a couple writeups for gods on this forum (Omicron's and Crumplepunch's come to mind) where they can access a sort of boss-fight super form.</div> </div> </div> </div>While she\u2019s no pushover, I don\u2019t think she\u2019s put a lot of work into refining personal combat abilities. Other than battle sorcery, the only other directly combat related skills I have her rated at 5 at are Dodge and Awareness (not that there aren\u2019t other elemental attacks in those other trees of course, that\u2019s the nature of Dragon-Blooded).<br /> <br /> If you jumped her, she\u2019s more likely to rely on her terrifying dodge, and manifest second circle demon body guards to defend her while she weaves battle spells or escapes.<br /> <br /> She does have the Heart of Creation hearthstone which lets her interface with the Sword. I\u2019m thinking it lets her unlock certain evocations that let her use certain Charms and Spells she possesses over long distances/ranges/magnitudes by expanding her own essence to act through the Realm Defense Grid.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-05T18:57:14-07:00","id":1215647,"title":"","content":"The Empress has been jumped by Lunars who knows how many times, that seems like plenty of reason to have made some serious combat investment by now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-05T19:04:17-07:00","id":1215648,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sith_Happens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1215647#post1215647\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Empress has been jumped by Lunars who knows how many times, that seems like plenty of reason to have made some serious combat investment by now.</div> </div> </div> </div>I feel as though the Empress would spend most of her time in the Imperial palace, in which case a Lunar that manages to get close to her has had to go through sorcerous defences and the palace guards, as well as any Dragon Blooded who happen to be there on business at the time, and even then the Empress will not be unguarded.<br /> <br /> \u200bI imagine that she wouldn't exactly be a pushover in personal combat, but that she's quite a bit short of Hitler being honed into a time-traveller destroying kung fu genius. That is to say, I can't imagine her own survival is utterly contingent on a capacity to take on Lunars in personal combat, so she could afford to not be the best personal fighter in the world.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-05T19:28:58-07:00","id":1215653,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1215644#post1215644\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">While she\u2019s no pushover, I don\u2019t think she\u2019s put a lot of work into refining personal combat abilities.</div> </div> </div> </div>Wasn't she a soldier before she was an empress?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-05T19:31:17-07:00","id":1215655,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sith_Happens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1215647#post1215647\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Empress has been jumped by Lunars who knows how many times, that seems like plenty of reason to have made some serious combat investment by now.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> That's a reason to keep high essence demons and elementals bound to her at all times, and be prepared to use Elusive Dragon-God Dispersion at the drop of a hat! And for Travel Without Distance to be her Celestial Control Spell. And she's got tricks like Dragon Vortex Attack, Terrifying Fire-Dragon Roar, and Eye of Blazing Truth up her sleeve, to say nothing of further battle sorcery - but she's &quot;only&quot; got Melee 4 (with a specialty in spears), and isn't a Martial Artist. She's not a &quot;behold my true form!&quot; uber-boss. If things have been reduced to one on one combat between herself and an Exalted opponent, things have gone terribly wrong. She has people for that. Well... not always &quot;people&quot;-people... but you get my point.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-05T19:43:57-07:00","id":1215657,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1215653#post1215653\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wasn't she a soldier before she was an empress?</div> </div> </div> </div>In my version, she was specifically an intelligence officer. Her favored abilities were awareness, bureaucracy, integrity, investigation, and lore.<br /> <br /> She\u2019s no slouch in Melee or War. Her natural ratings in both put her among elite mortals, so the excellencies alone take her to superhuman heights, but she\u2019s exceeded in those avenues by more focused Exalted. She is not a better field strategist than her best generals, that\u2019s why she uses them (in contrast, she has never had a &quot;minister of intelligence&quot; - the various intelligence networks of the Realm were guided by her personally, which leaves the All Seeing Eye in disorganized fragments with her disappearance).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 05-06-2018, 02:40 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-05T19:54:17-07:00","id":1215659,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1215648#post1215648\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I feel as though the Empress would spend most of her time in the Imperial palace, in which case a Lunar that manages to get close to her has had to go through sorcerous defences and the palace guards, as well as any Dragon Blooded who happen to be there on business at the time, and even then the Empress will not be unguarded.<br /> <br /> \u200bI imagine that she wouldn't exactly be a pushover in personal combat, but that she's quite a bit short of Hitler being honed into a time-traveller destroying kung fu genius. That is to say, I can't imagine her own survival is utterly contingent on a capacity to take on Lunars in personal combat, so she could afford to not be the best personal fighter in the world.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Exactly. She can hold her own and do some damage long enough for reinforcements or escape - but she's far from the most powerful Dragon-Blooded warrior in the Realm, especially assuming she's not allowed help from bound demons in that contest.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-05T20:06:50-07:00","id":1215663,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1215657#post1215657\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In my version, she was specifically an intelligence officer. Her favored abilities were awareness, bureaucracy, integrity, investigation, and lore.</div> </div> </div> </div>I know Aspect isn't everything, but that doesn't sound very Fire Aspect.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-05T20:32:17-07:00","id":1215668,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1215663#post1215663\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I know Aspect isn't everything, but that doesn't sound very Fire Aspect.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'll remind you that the gimmick of the Fire Aspected House Sesus is now that they've got a highly elaborate intelligence network for the purposes of covert operations and sabotage.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-05T20:52:56-07:00","id":1215671,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1215668#post1215668\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'll remind you that the gimmick of the Fire Aspected House Sesus is now that they've got a highly elaborate intelligence network for the purposes of covert operations and sabotage.</div> </div> </div> </div>You'll <i>inform </i>me. I've never studied the Great Houses.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-05T21:06:58-07:00","id":1215674,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1215671#post1215671\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You'll <i>inform </i>me. I've never studied the Great Houses.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bI could have sworn that I saw something suggesting that you've read What Fire Has Wrought.<br /> <br /> \u200bAnyway, in addition to House Sesus, the Fire Aspect write-up incorporates smoke and shadow symbolism into them, and refers to them as including talented intriguers that are good at keeping their own motives and passions hidden while giving a discerning eye to those around them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-05T21:08:16-07:00","id":1215675,"title":"","content":"...Ooh, you know what I just remembered?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>EX3 p.44</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">The ancient Solars cultivated their soldiers for mastery of miraculous arms and armor, and modern Dragon-Blooded are the beneficiaries of these regimens. Most Terrestrials carry heirloom artifacts, and\u2014with great effort\u2014may build deeper bonds of rapport with their storied daiklaves and invincible jade armor than any other Exalts, save the Solars themselves. <b>A rare few, including the Scarlet Empress, have even learned to draw forth secrets intended exclusively for the Solars alone.</b></div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-05T21:31:25-07:00","id":1215678,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1215674#post1215674\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">\u200bI could have sworn that I saw something suggesting that you've read What Fire Has Wrought.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, eagerly!<br /> <br /> Their history, Exaltation experience, Essence, Charms, Martial Arts, Sorcery, Artifacts...<br /> <br /> Not so much the Dynasty.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-05T21:34:49-07:00","id":1215681,"title":"","content":"Yeah, I'm wrestling with how much depth to go with her Evocations with her massive Artifact Arsenal. Obviously she's not carrying most on her at any given time.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-05T21:39:37-07:00","id":1215689,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1215678#post1215678\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Charms.</div> </div> </div> </div>Check out Socialize. Should make pretty clear the thematic axes that a Fire Aspected Intelligence Agent works along (in addition to Fire themed signature Charms for other appropriate Skills like Investigation, Bureaucracy, etc).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-05T21:51:20-07:00","id":1215693,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1215678#post1215678\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not so much the Dynasty.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bBut there's so much going on there. It's the kind of thing that provides a really strong example of what distinguishes the Dragon Blooded as an actual community of Exalted, as well as giving them a variety of achievements and agendas in the world.<br /> <br /> \u200bOne misses out on big things like House Sesus having a major intelligence network run by a secret council of mask-wearing spymasters, whose true identities are unknown to anybody, including one another.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-05T21:54:28-07:00","id":1215694,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1215693#post1215693\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> \u200bBut there's so much going on there. It's the kind of thing that provides a really strong example of what distinguishes the Dragon Blooded as an actual community of Exalted, as well as giving them a variety of achievements and agendas in the world.<br /> <br /> \u200bOne misses out on big things like House Sesus having a major intelligence network run by a secret council of mask-wearing spymasters, whose true identities are unknown to anybody, including one another.</div> </div> </div> </div>As a complete aside here, what\u2019s the impression you get of Sesus Raenyah\u2019s character and feelings about what\u2019s going on in her House?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-05T22:04:12-07:00","id":1215695,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1215693#post1215693\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">\u200bBut there's so much going on there.</div> </div> </div> </div>Exactly. And I'm not obligated to eat every book bigger than my head.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-05T22:19:59-07:00","id":1215699,"title":"","content":"This one's measured in kB though, that's hardly big. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-06T03:48:10-07:00","id":1215725,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1215694#post1215694\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> what\u2019s the impression you get of Sesus Raenyah\u2019s character and feelings about what\u2019s going on in her House?</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bI think it represents a good instance of how the spy network is not exactly the official remit of the House and more akin to a conspiracy that exists deeply embedded in them, as well as a nice instance of a matriarch somewhat at odds with her House and how there can be more forces guiding them than her singular will.<br /> <br /> \u200bIn her own right, I suppose it could be said that a personal interest in focusing on activities besides the spying speaks well of her character, unless one wishes to present her reticence as a bit more haughty. There's enough detail there to work with, but also enough left unstated to adjust to individual tastes.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-13T15:40:35-07:00","id":1218351,"title":"","content":"So she has a massive arsenal of First Age artifacts, but she obviously hasn't developed evocations with all or even most of them.<br /> <br /> What would you imagine needing coverage besides the Mantle of Brigid and the Heart of the Realm (n/a Hearthstone of the Imperial Manse, which she wears socketed in the clasp of the Mantle)?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-13T16:35:27-07:00","id":1218358,"title":"","content":"Didn't the write-up for the Singing Staff in prior Editions say that she possessed one of the four still known to exist?<br /> <br /> \u200bThat's an Artifact that I could see having Evocations in the same way that the Wings of the Raptor does; a representation of growing mastery of a basic power. Plus an effective way to let it have more impressive earth-moving effects that are still not immediately available to the first person that attunes it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-13T21:26:58-07:00","id":1218400,"title":"","content":"Working on her Intimacies<br /> <br /> Defining Principle: Only I can bear the burden of Creation<br /> Defining Principle: Conflict is eternal, &quot;Peace&quot; is merely conflict in balance against itself<br /> Defining Tie: Realm (Pride)<br /> Defining Tie: First Age Secrets (Covetous Desire)<br /> <br /> Major Tie: Lookshy (Grudging Respect)<br /> Major Tie: Chejop Kejak (Wary Resentment)<br /> Major Tie: Anathema (Jealousy)<br /> Major Tie: V'neef &amp; Mnemon (Impressed Curiosity)<br /> <br /> Minor Tie: Found Eggs (Trust)<br /> Minor Tie: Ragara (Fear)<br /> Minor Tie: Oban (Amused Affection)<br /> Minor Tie: Berit (Disappointment)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 04-04-2020, 02:17 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-14T01:52:32-07:00","id":1218442,"title":"","content":"Slight quibble<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1218400#post1218400\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Defining Principle: Only I can bare the burden of Creation</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bThis would mean that she's looking to expose or unveil the burden of Creation. The verb &quot;to bear&quot; means to carry something.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-14T10:02:12-07:00","id":1218596,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1218442#post1218442\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Slight quibble<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> \u200bThis would mean that she's looking to expose or unveil the burden of Creation. The verb &amp;quot;to bear&amp;quot; means to carry something.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks, brain fart","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-14T19:27:02-07:00","id":1218771,"title":"","content":"Would people rather her preserved life (she's around 800 at the time of her disappearance) be rooted in an Evocation from the Mantle of Brigid, or a Sorcerous Working? Either way, blood of Exalted longer lived than Dragon Blooded will be involved.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-14T19:37:55-07:00","id":1218776,"title":"","content":"Definitely the Working, though the Mantle should definitely have some means (or perhaps Means?) of assisting her in those.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-14T19:46:55-07:00","id":1218781,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sith_Happens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1218776#post1218776\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Definitely the Working, though the Mantle should definitely have some means (or perhaps Means?) of assisting her in those.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Well it's primary evocation does make her a Celestial Circle Sorcerer*, so that obviously ups her Workings.<br /> <br /> <br /> *Exalted doesn't use the term &quot;Sorceress&quot; right? Sorcerer is gender-neutral?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-14T21:22:23-07:00","id":1218798,"title":"","content":"How about a combination of both?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-15T03:29:08-07:00","id":1218850,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1218781#post1218781\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Exalted doesn't use the term &quot;Sorceress&quot; right? Sorcerer is gender-neutral?</div> </div> </div> </div>Princess is the term that Exalted doesn't like to use (when it's not part of someone's name) because the word has connotations of weakness. Sorceress has been thrown around in the past, I'm going to use a male sorceress as an NPC soon so I say whatever makes you feel pretty.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-15T11:50:51-07:00","id":1218983,"title":"","content":"I don't think Princess conotes weakness anymore. Between the likes of Leia, Luna-Celestia-Twilight, and the latest batch of Disney princesses I think it's lost any negative meaning (except when used to denote a girl who's spoiled)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-15T16:15:52-07:00","id":1219095,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1218983#post1218983\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't think Princess conotes weakness anymore. Between the likes of Leia, Luna-Celestia-Twilight, and the latest batch of Disney princesses I think it's lost any negative meaning (except when used to denote a girl who's spoiled)</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd <i>like</i> for that to be true, but something tells me we're still probably short of it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-15T17:35:53-07:00","id":1219123,"title":"","content":"There\u2019s also that \u201cPrince\u201d is often used in Exalted as an alternative to \u201cKing\u201d which has real life historical precedent. \u201cPrincess\u201d as an alternative to \u201cQueen(-regnant),\u201d on the other hand, was far less common.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":13313,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","user":"Sith_Happens","date":". 05-15-2018, 08:38 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-04T14:00:29-07:00","id":1378611,"title":"","content":"Now that we have the Charms for Heirs to the Shogunate, I thought I\u2019d note (one of? depends if I make her Essence 6 or7) the Empress\u2019 High Essence Charm(s).<br /> <br /> An upgrade to Dragon-Ancestor Bequest that removes the \u201cthat I Crafted\u201d requirement, and let\u2019s her count Lost Eggs who have sworn loyalty to her as \u201cHearthmates\u201d. So the Empress can activate Endowments in First Age warstriders when she throws a loyal Lost Egg in one in a Lunar Kaiju attack.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-04T16:18:40-07:00","id":1378628,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1378611#post1378611\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Now that we have the Charms for Heirs to the Shogunate, I thought I\u2019d note (one of? depends if I make her Essence 6 or7) the Empress\u2019 High Essence Charm(s).<br /> <br /> An upgrade to Dragon-Ancestor Bequest that removes the \u201cthat I Crafted\u201d requirement, and let\u2019s her count Lost Eggs who have sworn loyalty to her as \u201cHearthmates\u201d. So the Empress can activate Endowments in First Age warstriders when she throws a loyal Lost Egg in one in a Lunar Kaiju attack.</div> </div> </div> </div>That would still require the empress to be the sort of woman who makes the time to craft artifacts for other people, if she got as far as Dragon-Ancestor Bequest.<br /> <br /> I think she already had too many demands on her time, what with running an empire and mastering various martial arts to make herself as difficult to assassinate as possible, as well as developing her Lore and Occult as much as possible to attempt to further understand and master the Imperial Manse and the Sword of Creation.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-04T16:25:53-07:00","id":1378629,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1378628#post1378628\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That would still require the empress to be the sort of woman who makes the time to craft artifacts for other people, if she got as far as Dragon-Ancestor Bequest.<br /> <br /> I think she already had too many demands on her time, what with running an empire and mastering various martial arts to make herself as difficult to assassinate as possible, as well as developing her Lore and Occult as much as possible to attempt to further understand and master the Imperial Manse and the Sword of Creation.</div> </div> </div> </div>She canonically spends a lot of time working on First Age Artifacts in the Imperial Manse. Does repair not generate craft points?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-04T18:12:15-07:00","id":1378643,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1218351#post1218351\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So she has a massive arsenal of First Age artifacts, but she obviously hasn't developed evocations with all or even most of them.<br /> <br /> What would you imagine needing coverage besides the Mantle of Brigid and the Heart of the Realm (n/a Hearthstone of the Imperial Manse, which she wears socketed in the clasp of the Mantle)?</div> </div> </div> </div>I was given to understand that Heart of the Realm and two other stones were generally kept in the Imperial Crown. That might imply it is also an artifact, perhaps with evocations related to rulership.<br /> <br /> Also, if anyone in Creation has access to peaches of immortality, it would be her. That is another route to immortality.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-04T18:13:47-07:00","id":1378644,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1378629#post1378629\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> She canonically spends a lot of time working on First Age Artifacts in the Imperial Manse. Does repair not generate craft points?</div> </div> </div> </div>Dragon-Ancestor Bequest is not a repair Charm.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-04T18:17:17-07:00","id":1378645,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1378644#post1378644\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Dragon-Ancestor Bequest is not a repair Charm.</div> </div> </div> </div>That\u2019s not what I asked. Dragon-Ancestor Bequest requires the expenditure of Craft-points. My point was the Empress does do stuff to generate Craft points<br /> <br /> Also I\u2019m not aware of any reason to think she\u2019s a Martial Artist based on what we know in 3e. She avoids assassination with Awareness and Dodge Charms + Second Circle Demon bodyguards.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-04T21:56:17-07:00","id":1378673,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1378629#post1378629\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> She canonically spends a lot of time working on First Age Artifacts in the Imperial Manse. Does repair not generate craft points?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Quoting from the corebook:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Repair Rewards<br /> Repairing items generally requires a smaller investment<br /> of time and materials than making them anew, and as such,<br /> offers smaller rewards.<br /> \u2022 A basic repair project awards one silver point per basic<br /> objective triggered.<br /> \u2022 A major repair project grants one gold point per basic<br /> objective triggered.<br /> \u2022 Repairing a broken artifact with a superior repair project<br /> awards (Artifact\u2019s rating - 1) white experience points.<br /> \u2022 Repairing a broken N/A artifact with a legendary repair<br /> project grants no crafting experience points\u2014the reward<br /> for such endeavor is restoring the Essence and power of<br /> a lost wonder of the ages. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-05T00:21:41-07:00","id":1378690,"title":"","content":"Not all First Age artifacts are N/A-rated (and vice-versa).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-05T08:07:24-07:00","id":1378762,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1378690#post1378690\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not all First Age artifacts are N/A-rated (and vice-versa).</div> </div> </div> </div>Or even made with First Age Artifice. And not all examples of First Age Artifice were made in the First Age.<br /> <br /> Once again, I express my disgust with such an unwieldly and misleading term as &quot;First Age Artifice&quot;.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1378645#post1378645\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That\u2019s not what I asked. Dragon-Ancestor Bequest requires the expenditure of Craft-points. My point was the Empress does do stuff to generate Craft points</div> </div> </div> </div>Dragon-Ancestor Bequest requires that you build things yourself, for others.<br /> <br /> Yes, the Empress might spend her limited time repairing things and earning crafting points, but it does not logically follow that she would then spend even more of her now-even-more-limited time making new things for other people often enough to learn this Charm, especially not as a gateway to a Charm that she would use even less.<br /> <br /> I think she'd be more likely to find an Exalted Immaculate monk who is willing to swear an oath of eternal vigilance to fighting the Anathema, let them train in how to use one of her emergency Warstriders, and then sorcerously freeze that Exalt in the warstrider to be released whenever Lunar Godzilla shows up. And she could even get another sorcerer to do the freezing for her.<br /> <br /> That would be a far better use of her VAST resources as the Scarlet Empress of the Scarlet Dynasty of the Imperial Realm, without impinging on one of her most limited resources: Time.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Also I\u2019m not aware of any reason to think she\u2019s a Martial Artist based on what we know in 3e. She avoids assassination with Awareness and Dodge Charms + Second Circle Demon bodyguards. </div> </div> </div>The best victory is the battle never fought. An assassin can't get lucky if they can't catch you.<br /> <br /> I have a feeling that the devs might have said she was still a martial artist, but because the Search function of this forum sucks, I would need to manually crawl through the Ask The Devs thread to find proof.<br /> <br /> Is there any proof that she HASN'T mastered multiple Immaculate Dragon Arts, as in editions past?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-05T08:10:05-07:00","id":1378763,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1378645#post1378645\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That\u2019s not what I asked. Dragon-Ancestor Bequest requires the expenditure of Craft-points. My point was the Empress does do stuff to generate Craft points<br /> <br /> Also I\u2019m not aware of any reason to think she\u2019s a Martial Artist based on what we know in 3e. She avoids assassination with Awareness and Dodge Charms + Second Circle Demon bodyguards.</div> </div> </div> </div>I would wager she practices some for health reasons, and I didn't assume Mnemon was particularly Kung Fu till the chapter Fiction where she Palm Smashed the Assassin. But yeah I don't recall much on Kung Fu being the Empresses Method. I figured she might of been a Melee lady personally.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-05T09:16:46-07:00","id":1378773,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1378690#post1378690\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not all First Age artifacts are N/A-rated (and vice-versa).</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Where did I claim otherwise? He asked a question about repair rules and I quoted them from the book verbatim.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-05T09:37:54-07:00","id":1378779,"title":"","content":"I didn't say you'd made that claim. Was just reminding that the one class of repair projects that <i>don't</i> give craft points does not encompass the entirety of First Age artifice.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-05T11:16:31-07:00","id":1378803,"title":"","content":"<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Dragon-Ancestor Bequest requires that you build things yourself, for others.<br /> <br /> Yes, the Empress might spend her limited time repairing things and earning crafting points, but it does not logically follow that she would then spend even more of her now-even-more-limited time making new things for other people often enough to learn this Charm, especially not as a gateway to a Charm that she would use even less. </div> </div> </div>she made Imperator. She makes Artifacts to bequeath to Dynasts. That is established as a thing that happens in canon. Ergo she has use for it, and her High Essence upgrade makes it fit her more by allowing her to apply it to her First Age secret reserves. I doubt Imperator is the sole Artifact she\u2019s ever made, as she\u2019s unlikely to make one that powerful as a one off.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Is there any proof that she HASN'T mastered multiple Immaculate Dragon Arts, as in editions past? </div> </div> </div>As far as I recall we\u2019re talking about one stat block in late second edition.<br /> <br /> No nothing says she doesn\u2019t, but as you argued her time is finite, and as it doesn\u2019t fit her character remotely as much as her incessant exploration of First Age artifice, geomancy, and sorcery, if something takes the cut as extraneous, it\u2019s that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 04-05-2020, 02:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-05T11:22:18-07:00","id":1378806,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1378763#post1378763\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I would wager she practices some for health reasons, and I didn't assume Mnemon was particularly Kung Fu till the chapter Fiction where she Palm Smashed the Assassin. But yeah I don't recall much on Kung Fu being the Empresses Method. I figured she might of been a Melee lady personally.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, that\u2019s what I\u2019m going with. She has Melee 4 and favors her artifact spear. So superhuman relative to mortals, but not the best of the best among Exalted.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-05T11:27:54-07:00","id":1378810,"title":"","content":"I really like the idea of somebody taking the time to try statting and defining the Empress. It is an interesting thought experiment. The empress is often undetailed, and that is so people can fill her out the way they want, but too often that just results in people afraid to actually use her and make her a character.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-05T12:14:09-07:00","id":1378821,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1378806#post1378806\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yeah, that\u2019s what I\u2019m going with. She has Melee 4 and favors her artifact spear. So superhuman relative to mortals, but not the best of the best among Exalted.</div> </div> </div> </div>If she doesn't have Melee 5, I suggest ignoring the ability minimums for charms. She's not the Empress because she's the greatest fighter ever, but if she's going to be used as a big threat at the culmination of a story arc it would be good if she had access to a signature charm, or some of the Essence 3 ones that require Melee 5.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-05T12:26:05-07:00","id":1378825,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrLoveMonkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1378821#post1378821\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> If she doesn't have Melee 5, I suggest ignoring the ability minimums for charms. She's not the Empress because she's the greatest fighter ever, but if she's going to be used as a big threat at the culmination of a story arc it would be good if she had access to a signature charm, or some of the Essence 3 ones that require Melee 5.</div> </div> </div> </div>I\u2019m not sure she needs Melee signatures. She has a ton of other signatures (Awareness, Bureaucracy, Craft, Dodge, Integrity, Investigation, Linguistics, Lore, Occult, Performance, Presence, &amp; Socialize). Like I said, she doesn\u2019t have to be the best of the best of every skill she has, but is there a reason you think she\u2019d need the Melee ones specifically?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-05T14:19:28-07:00","id":1378842,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1378825#post1378825\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I\u2019m not sure she needs Melee signatures. She has a ton of other signatures (Awareness, Bureaucracy, Craft, Dodge, Integrity, Investigation, Linguistics, Lore, Occult, Performance, Presence, &amp; Socialize). Like I said, she doesn\u2019t have to be the best of the best of every skill she has, but is there a reason you think she\u2019d need the Melee ones specifically?</div> </div> </div> </div>She was a Shogunate officer who is Fire Aspected.<br /> <br /> I get not wanting to give her, say, Archery Signature Charms. Or Essence 5 Melee Charms. But I'd expect the Empress to have access to the mid-tier combat Charms of her own element.<br /> <br /> She doesn't need Charms like Mela's Flashing Tongue or Mirror-on-Water Focus. But I definitely see her with Harnessed Firestorm Attack and Falling Mountain Fang. <br /> <br /> She shouldn't be a combat monster but she needs to be able to hold her own against a moderately invested PC.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-05T14:49:35-07:00","id":1378847,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1378842#post1378842\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">She was a Shogunate officer who is Fire Aspected.<br /> <br /> I get not wanting to give her, say, Archery Signature Charms. Or Essence 5 Melee Charms. But I'd expect the Empress to have access to the mid-tier combat Charms of her own element.<br /> <br /> She doesn't need Charms like Mela's Flashing Tongue or Mirror-on-Water Focus. But I definitely see her with Harnessed Firestorm Attack and Falling Mountain Fang. <br /> <br /> She shouldn't be a combat monster but she needs to be able to hold her own against a moderately invested PC.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don\u2019t think every DB soldier is an elite master of a combat ability (which is what a rating of 5 represents). If an Ability rating of 4 doesn\u2019t reflect significant skill level than the system is failing to play out as described. I can think of no evidence in canon lore of her showing up other DBs as a master duelist.<br /> <br /> A Melee 5 Essence 3 Exalted with the appropriate Charms, will still find her able to throw up strong defenses, and vanishing into elemental conflagrations as their attacks pass through her (to say nothing of the attackers falling over themselves to accidentally attack each other and themselves), while elementals and second circle demons manifest to attack, giving her the room she needs to shape Sorcery attacks.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 04-05-2020, 05:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-05T21:38:04-07:00","id":1378921,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1378825#post1378825\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I\u2019m not sure she needs Melee signatures. She has a ton of other signatures (Awareness, Bureaucracy, Craft, Dodge, Integrity, Investigation, Linguistics, Lore, Occult, Performance, Presence, &amp; Socialize). Like I said, she doesn\u2019t have to be the best of the best of every skill she has, but is there a reason you think she\u2019d need the Melee ones specifically?</div> </div> </div> </div>The Scarlett Empress has a certain presence that I think she should live up to in some ways. I'm not saying &quot;give her melee 5&quot; but if she's the Empress of the great empire that your group is overthrowing, it might be something that you want to make her a big and memorable part of. Like a big flurry of attacks, or clashing an attack to form a huge steamcloud that fills the area.<br /> <br /> If she's not doing some stuff like that it might feel more like she's less present in the fight than her, admittedly powerful, bodyguards. Having excellent dodge is good, but I think there's something to be said for her having some really deadly offensive charms can make her more the focal point of the scene. I don't think she needs any E5 charms, or her own custom E6+ charms or anything like that, but there's some merit in giving her some flashy deadly offense.<br /> <br /> It's actually still pretty restrained, doing that would still put her as a worse fighter than Berit or Cathak Cainen. You could theoretically give her custom essence 6+ melee charms, one of the only Dragonblooded ever to be able to claim that honour. You could also say she's spent the centuries augmenting her body and soul with lost relics of the First Age found in the Imperial manse, and her own legendary sorcery to make herself the greatest terrestrial warrior alive. I think both of those are unnecessary.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-05T22:46:36-07:00","id":1378924,"title":"","content":"Celestial Circle spells aren't flashy deadly offensive enough for you? Tossing a Magma Kraken or Torrential Cascade into the fight seems pretty big and memorable.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-05T22:53:55-07:00","id":1378925,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrLoveMonkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1378921#post1378921\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The Scarlett Empress has a certain presence that I think she should live up to in some ways. I'm not saying &quot;give her melee 5&quot; but if she's the Empress of the great empire that your group is overthrowing, it might be something that you want to make her a big and memorable part of. Like a big flurry of attacks, or clashing an attack to form a huge steamcloud that fills the area.<br /> <br /> If she's not doing some stuff like that it might feel more like she's less present in the fight than her, admittedly powerful, bodyguards. Having excellent dodge is good, but I think there's something to be said for her having some really deadly offensive charms can make her more the focal point of the scene. I don't think she needs any E5 charms, or her own custom E6+ charms or anything like that, but there's some merit in giving her some flashy deadly offense.<br /> <br /> It's actually still pretty restrained, doing that would still put her as a worse fighter than Berit or Cathak Cainen. You could theoretically give her custom essence 6+ melee charms, one of the only Dragonblooded ever to be able to claim that honour. You could also say she's spent the centuries augmenting her body and soul with lost relics of the First Age found in the Imperial manse, and her own legendary sorcery to make herself the greatest terrestrial warrior alive. I think both of those are unnecessary.</div> </div> </div> </div>I\u2019m not following why that combat potency should be Melee specifically though, and not her epic mastery of the elemental attacks in Lore, battle Sorcery, maybe high Essence enhancements to Eyes of Blazing Truth or Terrifying Fire Dragon Roar, etc? Wouldn\u2019t those be a lot more in theme for her as one of the most feared sorceresses in Creation, who has never to my recollection ever been portrayed as a duelist?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-06T00:19:26-07:00","id":1378942,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1378924#post1378924\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Celestial Circle spells aren't flashy deadly offensive enough for you? Tossing a Magma Kraken or Torrential Cascade into the fight seems pretty big and memorable.</div> </div> </div> </div>Magma Kraken is like, a dedicated 4-5 turn spell to be casting for a Terrestrial sorceress. It's not a lot for her to be doing while the actual fight is going on.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1378925#post1378925\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I\u2019m not following why that combat potency should be Melee specifically though, and not her epic mastery of the elemental attacks in Lore, battle Sorcery, maybe high Essence enhancements to Eyes of Blazing Truth or Terrifying Fire Dragon Roar, etc? Wouldn\u2019t those be a lot more in theme for her as one of the most feared sorceresses in Creation, who has never to my recollection ever been portrayed as a duelist?</div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe you're right, but it just feels weird that the Empress doesn't actually have that much to do if a final confrontation breaks out in her throneroom. It's just her various guards and allies fighting while she runs off trying to keep safe. It makes sense, it's a smart tactic, but it doesn't feel satisfying to me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-06T00:30:00-07:00","id":1378945,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrLoveMonkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1378942#post1378942\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> <br /> Maybe you're right, but it just feels weird that the Empress doesn't actually have that much to do if a final confrontation breaks out in her throneroom. It's just her various guards and allies fighting while she runs off trying to keep safe. It makes sense, it's a smart tactic, but it doesn't feel satisfying to me.</div> </div> </div> </div>she can go full Palpatine/Azula hurling Essence Lightning from her safe distance, while Second Circle Demons materialize to stop attackers from getting too close. Not to mention magically backed social actions from that position. I\u2019m sure more than a few would be assassins surrendered to her compelling commands!<br /> <br /> i think if I wanted a game to culminate in a direct fight with the empress where she isn\u2019t relying on bound Demon and Elemental defenders to make her social or sorcerers attacks from a safe distance - I\u2019d make it a warstrider battle, so she can flex the Evocations to reflect her exploration of first age tech in the Imperial Manse","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 04-06-2020, 03:40 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-06T00:39:15-07:00","id":1378947,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1378945#post1378945\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> she can go full Palpatine/Azula hurling Essence Lightning from her safe distance, while Second Circle Demons materialize to stop attackers from getting too close. Not to mention magically backed social actions from that position. I\u2019m sure more than a few would be assassins surrendered to her compelling commands!</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, I might just be too attached to the image of her from Return of the Scarlet Empress, where the ultimate showdown with the Empress and her demons had her wielding the Eye of the Fire Dragon and clashing with the PCs directly. What about thrown/archery and using that new Lore charm from Heirs to the Shogunate to add effects to Elemental Bolt Attack? Like using Dragonfly Finds Mate to strike an incoming arrow out of the sky with a blast of icy wind.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-06T01:39:19-07:00","id":1378949,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrLoveMonkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1378947#post1378947\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yeah, I might just be too attached to the image of her from Return of the Scarlet Empress, where the ultimate showdown with the Empress and her demons had her wielding the Eye of the Fire Dragon and clashing with the PCs directly. What about thrown/archery and using that new Lore charm from Heirs to the Shogunate to add effects to Elemental Bolt Attack? Like using Dragonfly Finds Mate to strike an incoming arrow out of the sky with a blast of icy wind.</div> </div> </div> </div>My problem with that, is that we're now piling out of aspect combat abilities onto her instead of adding a single measly Ability dot.<br /> <br /> Even throwing lightning is Air Aspected in Exalted, not Fire.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-06T02:12:26-07:00","id":1378952,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1378949#post1378949\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My problem with that, is that we're now piling out of aspect combat abilities onto her instead of adding a single measly Ability dot.<br /> <br /> Even throwing lightning is Air Aspected in Exalted, not Fire.</div> </div> </div> </div>one measly dot and a ton of charms it\u2019s being argued to add to unlock. That\u2019s the issue, not the one dot. As she\u2019s not a noted duelist, I don\u2019t want to stack her with combat charms from an ability that isn\u2019t that important for her.<br /> <br /> As for Aspect: I\u2019ve said before that her signature charm selection when lined up based on her themes and deeds ended up heavily favoring air after fire, so I was leaning into an interpretation where fire displays of power crackle with lightning along with flame. Going out of aspect is not a concern for me, nor is adding or removing 1 dot, my determining question is what powers fit her presented themes and canonical actions in the setting.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-06T02:19:02-07:00","id":1378953,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrLoveMonkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1378947#post1378947\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yeah, I might just be too attached to the image of her from Return of the Scarlet Empress, where the ultimate showdown with the Empress and her demons had her wielding the Eye of the Fire Dragon and clashing with the PCs directly. What about thrown/archery and using that new Lore charm from Heirs to the Shogunate to add effects to Elemental Bolt Attack? Like using Dragonfly Finds Mate to strike an incoming arrow out of the sky with a blast of icy wind.</div> </div> </div> </div>She definitely has Mantle of Elemental Power so can use Elemental Bolt to parry, yes! Doing Archery over Melee as her main traditional martial ability is an interesting suggestion, that could make a lot of sense - despite lack of a lot of battlefield action in recent centuries, she could stay in practice hunting!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 04-06-2020, 05:42 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-06T03:35:48-07:00","id":1378967,"title":"","content":"Another idea if I was going to play up melee is go back to my original post and make Virtuous Guardian of Flame a Control Spell, so she can throw in Evocations, and make that her combat move of last resorts that still nods toward her Sorcery even while using Melee.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-06T04:23:32-07:00","id":1378971,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1378952#post1378952\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> one measly dot and a ton of charms it\u2019s being argued to add to unlock. That\u2019s the issue, not the one dot.</div> </div> </div> </div>You realize I suggested two Charms, neither of which have prereques, right?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-06T07:40:20-07:00","id":1378987,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1378971#post1378971\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You realize I suggested two Charms, neither of which have prereques, right?</div> </div> </div> </div>Signature Charms are pretty significant and I already feel bad enough giving her them in 12 Abilities that actually thematically fit.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-06T13:10:40-07:00","id":1379043,"title":"","content":"In order to do those high end craft projects she would need to have fairly significant Lore anyway.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-08T09:36:51-07:00","id":1379484,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1378987#post1378987\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Signature Charms are pretty significant and I already feel bad enough giving her them in 12 Abilities that actually thematically fit.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm probably too wedded to the previous statline in my head, but was always struck by the fact that she didn't have Immaculate MAs (she knew Five-Dragon, Terrestrial Hero and White Veil, plus had top-end (5/8, +3 specialty) in melee with her spear).<br /> <br /> On the one hand it hinted towards her age (she largely learned to kickass BEFORE the IMAs were invented) and that she simply was too busy/focused on the dedicated empire-building stuff \u2013 by the gonzo standards of RotSE that felt a pretty deliberate exclusion and a sign fighting charms were not anywhere on her later agenda.<br /> <br /> On the other hand, I get an argument I've heard elsewhere that the world's most suspicious person would have wanted to have a better idea of <i>exactly</i> what Chejop Kejak's crew were teaching her scions with the IMAs and demanded instruction from the very best so she could have learned it first-hand (plus just really like the idea of Chejop instructing her personally - the distrust on both sides etc). RotSE did imply greed for knowledge and power was an ever growing aspect of her nature if I remember right.<br /> <br /> --<br /> <br /> I'd personally expect her to be very, very good in a fight (and do think melee suits her better than any of 3e's IMAs) but am really intrigued by your vision, sounds really cool. She doesn't have to throw lightning either, surely massive great fireballs is evocative enough? I'mma thinking Jeong Jeong in the Last Airbender: <a href=\"https://youtu.be/rxkT7cwoRRY?t=39\" target=\"_blank\">https://youtu.be/rxkT7cwoRRY?t=39</a><br /> <br /> Would love to see the statline when you settle on it. It'll be hard to know where to stop on her Essence 6 charms... sorcery, the RDG, bureaucracy, being 'unknowable'...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24647,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24647-moss-reynholm","user":"Moss Reynholm","date":". 04-08-2020, 01:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24647-moss-reynholm","name":"Moss Reynholm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24647_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-08T14:35:56-07:00","id":1379524,"title":"","content":"The Immaculate Styles were invented in the Shogunate - they predate her by centuries.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-08T22:34:04-07:00","id":1379640,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1379524#post1379524\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Immaculate Styles were invented in the Shogunate - they predate her by centuries.</div> </div> </div> </div>Of course they do. What a massive brain fart on my part. Ignore me...<br /> <br /> EDIT: Skimmed the chapter comic where Chejop grouses about 'giving' the SE his Immaculate Order (a favourite) and my sleep addled memory put 2 and 2 and got 74...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24647,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24647-moss-reynholm","user":"Moss Reynholm","date":". 04-09-2020, 03:08 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24647-moss-reynholm","name":"Moss Reynholm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24647_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-09T19:22:40-07:00","id":1379995,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrLoveMonkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1378942#post1378942\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Maybe you're right, but it just feels weird that the Empress doesn't actually have that much to do if a final confrontation breaks out in her throneroom. It's just her various guards and allies fighting while she runs off trying to keep safe. It makes sense, it's a smart tactic, but it doesn't feel satisfying to me.</div> </div> </div> </div>If a final confrontation breaks out against the returned Empress in her throne room then the throne is secretly a warstrider and one of the Mantle\u2019s Evocations is \u201cPoised Lion Attitude but for shaping actions.\u201d <i>Clearly</i>. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-09T19:47:56-07:00","id":1380000,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sith_Happens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213530-statting-up-the-scarlet-empress?p=1379995#post1379995\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> If a final confrontation breaks out against the returned Empress in her throne room then the throne is secretly a warstrider and one of the Mantle\u2019s Evocations is \u201cPoised Lion Attitude but for shaping actions.\u201d <i>Clearly</i>. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>A five headed draconic jade warstrider that enhances sorcery provided the spell-effect is elemental.... I kind of love that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-09T19:56:12-07:00","id":1380004,"title":"","content":"Hell I'd be interested in stating that up, it be one hella an Artifact. The Throne of the Scarlet Empress. Hm, it would be 5 dot yeah? While.i do think the Empress has the legend and tools to possibly craft a N/A Artifact, going past the limits of the Dragon-Blooded. She already have the Sword of Creation though, so no need to add another I would think.<br /> <br /> Oh then that's another thing, in a possible boss fight with Empress, that would be her trump card wouldn't it, the Sword. Hm","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#b22222\"><b>.</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3742-iceblade44","name":"Iceblade44","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","cust